      "seed": 1685008582,
      "version": 560,
      "versionNonce": 1682731261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787061644362,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "第一次握手：Client -> Server（SYN）\n客户端发送：SYN = 1, seq = x\n\n第二次握手：Server -> Client（SYN-ACK）\n服务端发送：SYN = 1, ACK = 1, seq = y, ack = x + 1\n\n第三次握手：Client -> Server（ACK）\n客户端发送：ACK = 1, seq = x + 1, ack = y + 1",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "第一次握手：Client -> Server（SYN）\n客户端发送：SYN = 1, seq = x\n\n第二次握手：Server -> Client（SYN-ACK）\n服务端发送：SYN = 1, ACK = 1, seq = y, ack = x + 1\n\n第三次握手：Client -> Server（ACK）\n客户端发送：ACK = 1, seq = x + 1, ack = y + 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
